Within a week,

301
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:18,220
Americans were shown one

302
00:08:18,260 --> 00:08:19,680
sentence from the letter,

303
00:08:19,770 --> 00:08:20,950
slightly shortened.

304
00:08:21,410 --> 00:08:23,170
That these machines do not feel

305
00:08:23,210 --> 00:08:25,380
joy or pain, and do not know

306
00:08:25,420 --> 00:08:27,680
from within what love, work,

307
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:30,360
friendship or responsibility mean.

308
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:32,830
83% agreed.

309
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:34,500
A poll proves nothing.

310
00:08:34,540 --> 00:08:35,870
But on how these

311
00:08:35,910 --> 00:08:36,890
machines are made,

312
00:08:36,930 --> 00:08:38,390
and who steers them,

313
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:39,750
one of their builders came

314
00:08:39,790 --> 00:08:40,600
to the Vatican

315
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:42,210
and said much the same.

316
00:08:42,650 --> 00:08:43,710
This is not Rome

317
00:08:43,750 --> 00:08:45,330
against Silicon Valley.

318
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,530
On the rest,

319
00:08:46,570 --> 00:08:48,310
the test is your own life.

320
00:08:48,910 --> 00:08:49,780
The letter carries

321
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,640
its own hopeful reading.

322
00:08:51,980 --> 00:08:53,360
Technology turned toward

323
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:54,920
freeing human time,

324
00:08:55,030 --> 00:08:56,690
not shutting people out.

325
00:08:57,880 --> 00:09:00,100
None of this arrives by itself.

326
00:09:00,270 --> 00:09:01,780
The future of these machines,

327
00:09:01,820 --> 00:09:02,820
the Pope says,

328
00:09:02,910 --> 00:09:04,880
depends on the choices we make.

329
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:06,840
The labs set the pace.

330
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:08,620
Governments write the rules,

331
00:09:08,660 --> 00:09:09,730
or fail to.

332
00:09:10,010 --> 00:09:12,150
And governments answer to you.

333
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:13,540
Now look at both

334
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:14,780
sides of the scale.

335
00:09:15,060 --> 00:09:15,910
On the left,

336
00:09:15,950 --> 00:09:16,890
everything a machine

337
00:09:16,930 --> 00:09:18,430
can take off your hands.

338
00:09:18,550 --> 00:09:19,340
The illness.

339
00:09:19,380 --> 00:09:20,300
The bills.

340
00:09:20,340 --> 00:09:21,960
The work that wears you out.

341
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:23,360
On the right,

342
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,220
what cannot be handed over.

343
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:26,470
Who you sit with.

344
00:09:26,590 --> 00:09:27,820
Who you answer for.

345
00:09:27,990 --> 00:09:29,860
What you do on a Tuesday morning.

346
00:09:30,460 --> 00:09:31,730
The Pope has a sentence

347
00:09:31,770 --> 00:09:32,770
for that side.

348
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:34,520
What saves humanity

349
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:37,070
is not enhanced self-sufficiency,

350
00:09:37,290 --> 00:09:39,610
but a relationship that liberates.

351
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,080
Put plainly.

352
00:09:41,470 --> 00:09:42,850
Artificial intelligence can

353
00:09:42,890 --> 00:09:44,040
save your body,

354
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,860
your time and your money.

355
00:09:46,300 --> 00:09:47,400
What you do with them

356
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,590
is the one job it cannot take.

357
00:09:50,950 --> 00:09:51,840
At the start,

358
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:52,640
you named what you

359
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:54,030
would hand a machine.

360
00:09:54,380 --> 00:09:56,300
Now name what you would keep.

361
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,760
This channel exists so

362
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,520
that the arrival

363
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,630
of superintelligence

364
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:02,380
goes well for everybody,

365
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,370
not only for the people

366
00:10:03,410 --> 00:10:04,410
who build it.

367
00:10:04,550 --> 00:10:05,550
Want that too?

368
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:06,630
Then subscribe.

